---
import { DEMO_URL, DEPLOY_URL } from "../../site";
---
<div class="wrap hero">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Open source · Runs on Cloudflare</p>
    <h1>All the world's<br /><em>a stage.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">OpenAct is a framework for the apps that run your company. It comes with Projects, a working app for project management. Build more apps with help from AI coding agents. You own the code and the data.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href={DEPLOY_URL}>Deploy to Cloudflare</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost arrow" href={DEMO_URL}>Try the demo</a>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Apache License 2.0. The demo is free. You do not need a password.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="stage-key">
    <div class="card terminal" aria-label="Deploy OpenAct from a terminal">
      <div class="head"><span>~/openact</span><i></i></div>
      <pre><span class="p">$</span> git clone github.com/marketgrowth/openact
<span class="p">$</span> npm install
<span class="p">$</span> npm run deploy
<span class="c">  migrations applied · worker live</span>
<span class="p">$</span> <span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></pre>
      <div class="done">
        <span class="chip ok">Projects · on</span>
        <span class="chip">D1 · R2 · Workers</span>
        <span class="chip">your account</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
